; The justice condition watches mode, and spare influences nothing. Neither
; bit is given an initial value, so the cone of influence can drop spare from
; the system entirely rather than only from the transition relation.
1 sort bitvec 1
2 state 1 mode
3 next 1 2 2
4 state 1 spare
5 not 1 4
6 next 1 4 5
7 justice 1 2
